								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3002.msg34490#msg34490">ASCAP sues Ibiza Nightclub for failing to pay royalities for the music they play</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> August 01, 2007, 12:31:18 pm &#187;</div></td>
